  "_descModCreate": {
    "EN": "Creating a mode card allows you to add a new mode to the monitoring with unique images, videos, and description. This is a great way to highlight specific modes and attract users' attention. Submodes allow you to create variations of the main mode, giving you flexibility in organizing and displaying information on your site.",
